#: src/collaboration/overview.md:3
msgid "Collaboration"
msgstr "協作"

#: src/collaboration/overview.md:5
msgid ""
"Zed supports real-time multiplayer editing. Multiple people can work in the "
"same project simultaneously, seeing each other's cursors and edits as they "
"happen."
msgstr ""

#: src/collaboration/overview.md:7
msgid ""
"Open the Collaboration Panel with <kbd class=\"keybinding\">cmd-shift-c|ctrl-"
"shift-c</kbd>. You'll need to [sign in](../authentication.md#signing-in) to "
"access collaboration features."
msgstr ""

#: src/collaboration/overview.md:9
msgid "Collaboration Panel"
msgstr ""

#: src/collaboration/overview.md:11
msgid "The Collaboration Panel has two sections:"
msgstr ""

#: src/collaboration/overview.md:13
msgid ""
"[Channels](./channels.md): Persistent project rooms for team collaboration, "
"with shared projects and voice chat."
msgstr ""

#: src/collaboration/overview.md:14
msgid ""
"[Contacts and Private Calls](./contacts-and-private-calls.md): Your contacts "
"list for ad-hoc private sessions."
msgstr ""

#: src/collaboration/overview.md:16
msgid ""
"**Warning:** Sharing a project gives collaborators access to your local file "
"system within that project. Only collaborate with people you trust."
msgstr ""

#: src/collaboration/overview.md:18
msgid ""
"See the [Data and Privacy FAQs](https://zed.dev/faq#data-and-privacy) for "
"more details."
msgstr ""

#: src/collaboration/overview.md:20
msgid "Audio Settings"
msgstr ""

#: src/collaboration/overview.md:22
msgid "Selecting Audio Devices"
msgstr ""

#: src/collaboration/overview.md:24
msgid ""
"You can select specific input and output audio devices instead of using "
"system defaults. To configure audio devices:"
msgstr ""

#: src/collaboration/overview.md:26
msgid "Open <kbd class=\"keybinding\">cmd-,|ctrl-,</kbd>"
msgstr ""

#: src/collaboration/overview.md:27
msgid "Navigate to **Collaboration** > **Experimental**"
msgstr ""

#: src/collaboration/overview.md:28
msgid ""
"Use the **Output Audio Device** and **Input Audio Device** dropdowns to "
"select your preferred devices"
msgstr ""

#: src/collaboration/overview.md:30
msgid ""
"Changes take effect immediately. If you select a device that becomes "
"unavailable, Zed falls back to system defaults."
msgstr ""

#: src/collaboration/overview.md:32
msgid ""
"To test your audio configuration, click **Test Audio** in the same section. "
"This opens a window where you can verify your microphone and speaker work "
"correctly with the selected devices."
msgstr ""

#: src/collaboration/overview.md:34
msgid "**JSON configuration:**"
msgstr ""

#: src/collaboration/overview.md:38
msgid "\"audio\""
msgstr ""

#: src/collaboration/overview.md:39
msgid "\"experimental.output_audio_device\""
msgstr ""

#: src/collaboration/overview.md:39 src/collaboration/overview.md:40
msgid "\"Device Name (device-id)\""
msgstr ""

#: src/collaboration/overview.md:40
msgid "\"experimental.input_audio_device\""
msgstr ""

#: src/collaboration/overview.md:45
msgid "Set either value to `null` to use system defaults."
msgstr ""
